### 5. Duplicate Question Detector — Embeddings ⭐

A company has thousands of support questions.

For example:

```text
"How can I reset my password?"

"I forgot my password. How do I change it?"
```

The system should determine whether they represent the **same problem**.

Build:

* Embedding generation
* Similarity calculation
* Threshold-based duplicate detection

Example:

```text
Similarity > 0.85 → Probably duplicate
Similarity < 0.50 → Probably different
```

Don't blindly assume those thresholds are universally correct—experiment with your dataset.

