### 6. Resume Analyzer — Structured Output ⭐⭐⭐

Build an AI resume analyzer.

Input:

```text
Resume text
```

The LLM must return structured data:

```text
{
    "name": "...",
    "skills": [],
    "education": [],
    "experience": [],
    "projects": [],
    "missing_skills": []
}
```

**Challenge:** What happens when the resume doesn't contain experience?

Your application should still return a valid structure.

