### 12. Smart Calculator — Tools ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐

Build an AI calculator.

The user can ask:

```text
"What is 25% of 840?"

"Calculate EMI for a loan."

"Convert 10 kilometers to miles."
```

Create separate tools:

```text
percentage_calculator()
emi_calculator()
unit_converter()
```

The LLM should decide which tool to call.

**Challenge:** The LLM should not perform the calculation itself when a calculator tool is available.

